factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the Udumalai road, Palani road, Kaniyur road and Kumaralingam road meet at the junction; the draft's reel_script and caption say the four roads meet, which is consistent, but the caption says 'உடுமலை, பழநி, கணியூர், குமரலிங்கம் ஆகிய சாலைகள்' which is fine — however the reel_script says 'உடுமலை அருகே உள்ள மடத்துக்குளம்' (Madathukulam near Udumalai), an added location relation not stated in the article
  The caption adds 'இந்தச் சந்திப்பில் வாகனங்களை கவனமாக ஓட்டுங்கள்' (drive carefully at this junction) as a public advisory, which is not in the article
  The reel_script says drivers 'கவலை தெரிவித்துள்ளனர்' (expressed worry); the article only says drivers expect a roundabout and people and drivers urged action, so the worry framing is an embellishment
  The article says accidents 'ஏற்பட வாய்ப்புள்ளது' (may occur); the slides_spec headline 'நெரிசலும் விபத்தும் அதிகம்' (congestion and accidents are high) states accidents as a fact, which the article does not say
  The reel_script states that accidents may occur due to congestion as a cause; the article's causal link is that absence of roundabout causes frequent congestion and therefore accident possibility, which the reel roughly follows, but the caption's '👮 கோரிக்கை' attribution to the highway department is consistent; no arrest or result is missing
